+/// Whether a rejected sample lies on the sample grid at most
+/// [`MAX_REDELIVERED_SAMPLES`] behind the previous one, as a re-delivered
+/// sample does.
+///
+/// A stall past half the counter range lands here only if it ends within
+/// that many samples of a whole number of counter wraps. Below 1000 SPS the
+/// step does not divide the counter range, so that takes several wraps.
+fn is_redelivered(previous: u16, current: u16, rate: GraphSampleRate) -> bool {
+    let step = rate.sequence_step();
+    let behind_ticks = previous.wrapping_sub(current);
